 is read from NVS and the device starts in Waiting." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="510" width="700" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
